resources.string:
1. If you want to use the Matter protocol to control devices, you must first add Matter gateway support in your network;
2. One or more Matter gateways have been added to the network, you need to set in My -> More Services -> Matter Synchronization Select a gateway in , and synchronize the device information to the gateway, so that the device supports Matter protocol control;
3, please turn on Bluetooth during the synchronization process, and keep the mobile phone as close as possible to the gateway, so as to facilitate the Bluetooth connection to the corresponding gateway to synchronize device information;
4, only support Only devices with Matter protocol can be synchronized;

Try the following possible solutions: 
1. Power off and restart the device; 
2. Restart the Bluetooth of the phone; 
3. Add the failed devices again;

1.The device failure or is not powered on;
2.The Bluetooth of the phone is not turned on, or it is not authorized to use;
3.The phone is far away from the device, out of the signal range. Please try to keep within 10 meters;
4.The device has been connected by other phone, and each device can only be connected to one phone. As long as the phone is connected to one device, it can control all devices in the MESH network.
